OL,3,AStorm Austen brings power cuts and
OL,4,Atravel disruption as more wind and rain
OL,5,Aforecast
OL,6,
OL,7,FMore than 10,000 homes are without
OL,8,Fpower as Storm Austen continues to
OL,9,Fbatter southern England and Wales, with
OL,10,Fmore bad weather expected this weekend.
OL,12,FThe first named storm of the season
OL,13,Fbrought gusts of up to 84mph (135km/h)
OL,14,Fto Jersey, while in southern England
OL,15,Fthe wild weather disrupted travel with
OL,16,Ffallen trees blocking railway lines and
OL,17,Froads.
OL,19,FIn Brighton, part of the iconic West
OL,20,FPier - an abandoned structure that
OL,21,Ffirst opened in 1866 - collapsed into
OL,22,Fthe sea.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
