OL,3,ASeven shot dead by gunmen at church
OL,4,Afuneral in Jordan, officials say
OL,5,
OL,6,FSeven people have been killed in an
OL,7,Fattack on a funeral in central Jordan,
OL,8,Fofficials have said.
OL,10,FAt least 34 others were injured as
OL,11,Fgunmen opened fire on a church in
OL,12,FHmoud, in the Karak governorate on
OL,13,FFriday.
OL,15,FThe unidentified gunmen are reported to
OL,16,Fhave arrived in a car, entered the
OL,17,Fchurch and opened fire before fleeing.
OL,18,FNo-one has admitted carrying out the
OL,19,Fattack.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/39
